      "publishedAt": "2013-06-17T04:39:52.000Z",
      "channelId": "UC__tx0d7Es1AqipV3nLSw4w",
      "title": "Introduction to JavaScript Unit Testing with Venus.js",
      "description": "This talk begins with a brief overview of different ways to test code written for the web, including black-box vs. white-box testing techniques. From here, we focus on white-box unit testing and how to write unit tests for JavaScript code using Venus.js. By the end of the session, you will understand why unit testing is important, the challenges involved in unit testing JavaScript code, and the tools and techniques which are available to overcome these challenges.",
