      "title": "Graphics on the web with Eric Rowell",
      "description": "How do you create data visualizations and other graphics in the browser, with technologies like SVG and Canvas? What are the pros and cons of the different technologies? What are the popular JavaScript libraries for graphics on the web, and how do you pick which one to use?\n\nEric Rowell is a Senior Web Developer at LinkedIn. Outside of his day job, Eric is the author of KineticJS. He is also the creator of HTML5CanvasTutorials.com, and author of the highly rated HTML5 Canvas Cookbook.",
